{"id":"n23578-1-11","stage":4,"title":"기미 · 苗头","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n23578-1-11-1","ko":"그 남자가 금연을 할 것 같아요?","zh":"那个男人会戒烟吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个。","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"1","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}},{"text":"남자가","meaning":"男子，男人","explanation":"남자：男子，男人；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"남자","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60865","senseId":"1","lemma":"남자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남자가","audio":"/audio/2febf4b5eefa29bbf8ef.mp3"}},{"text":"금연을","meaning":"戒烟","explanation":"금연：戒烟；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"금연","audio":"/audio/00ec645587cb9417a86a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60641","senseId":"2","lemma":"금연","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"금연을","audio":"/audio/6e3d8af6d9e3fcc94292.mp3"}},{"text":"할","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할","audio":"/audio/3b4c012b3f82dedb34a0.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아요?","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아요","audio":"/audio/d27f58354e12c6dc5616.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"43883","definition":"指代与听话人较近或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"c6a3b6d97217b4d8","term":"남자","zh":"男子，男人","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3","entryId":"60865","definition":"作为男性出生的人。","pronunciation":["남자"]},{"id":"00ec645587cb9417","term":"금연","zh":"戒烟","audio":"/audio/00ec645587cb9417a86a.mp3","entryId":"60641","definition":"曾经抽烟的人戒除吸香烟的嗜好。","pronunciation":["그ː면"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/fb8d940ce1c8a686c278.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n23578-1-11-2","ko":"아니요. 그럴 기미조차 보이지 않던데요.","zh":"不会的。他连要戒烟的迹象都没有啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니요.","meaning":"不是，不用","explanation":"아니요：不是，不用。","readings":[{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17189","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}},{"text":"그럴","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럴","audio":"/audio/96ad41e9f36f46d9e15d.mp3"}},{"text":"기미조차","meaning":"苗头，迹象，征兆","explanation":"기미：苗头，迹象，征兆；조차：表示“连……都、甚至……也”，